      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14714,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767975721766665
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely. Just to confirm for our records, the return reason is preference due to the color, and for safety reasons, we do require that the helmet is unused, which you've confirmed since the box is unopened.",
